  "name": "Presence of the Arbiter",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/Arbiter_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You project an aura of calm and surety to your allies, and one of fear and menace to your enemies.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you and any allies within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you are immune to being <strong>Charmed</strong> or <strong>Frightened</strong>. Any allies that are currently <strong>Charmed</strong> or <strong>Frightened</strong> immediately recover from those conditions.</p><p>Additionally, make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check. Until the start of your next turn, any enemy that moves within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you must make an opposed <strong>Willpower</strong> check or become <strong>Frightened</strong> of you until the start of your next turn. Any enemies already within <strong>5 spaces</strong> of you must immediately make this check.</p>",
